ss_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"kFwYrDiiVuaEuw1WIV260w","review_id":"a9k4zwogauVmTYKlKTVIMA","date":"2016-04-20T18:41:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9451620578765869,"text_excerpt":"Quick points: AMAZING, sit outside, must get the Zeppole for dessert . I go to school in New Orleans and am a major foodie. Ever since AVO opened, the outside has really appealed to me and I have always wanted to try it. My expectations were exceeded. I now have a new restaurant to add to my favorites in the city. We sat in the walled-in courtyard attached to the restaurant. It is such an awesome, beautiful and romantic space. The walls have a few wooden shelves on them, upon which, several big candles are burning. It is a beautiful spot. The Buratta salad appetizer was really good, and came with arugula and fresh strawberries and raspberries. We also had the side of cauliflower which I a..."},{"business_id":"kFwYrDiiVuaEuw1WIV260w","review_id":"Lp3cvEkAuJJKCrTulWqzrw","date":"2016-10-06T01:50:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.943359375,"text_excerpt":"I've been meaning to do a review on this place, but i was so busy. But anyways, my friend and I went to Avo during restaurant week in Nola. Plus it was also my birthday week so double bonus! Haha. The both of us went during 8-9 pm. From the outside, the place look really small, but when you get inside its big. The place is really spacious and nice. I felt I was at a fancy dine in. The service was good and the food were fantastic!! The three course meal consisted of the charred octopus, duck confit and a dessert of your choice. All of the food choices were fantastic, especially the charred octopus. The octopus was very tender and not chewy! It had a sweet but a spicy kick to it, which I re..."},{"business_id":"kFwYrDiiVuaEuw1WIV260w","review_id":"Ro3FVeGFLUam39I0Ig-PSA","date":"2016-02-28T21:10:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9379675984382629,"text_excerpt":"We ate here on Valentine's Day and I know there is a stigma about doing that but not for Avo. The service was perfect. We loved or waiter - Ridge. We had the 5 course wine pairing dinner. First course was the tuna crudo. Very good, small portion but loved the basil and that there was so much going on in such a small dish. Next were the scallops! I loved those and will be back for them. It was like candy and cooked perfectly. Next, the gnocchi itself didn't have much flavor but loved the mushroom Ragu it was served on top of. The braised short I didn't care for, but the hubby devoured. I found it to be just too meat flavored, not any sauce and that's what he liked about it. The zeppole for..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"kFwYrDiiVuaEuw1WIV260w","photo_id":"lRWOJSkPcby1Iv3A3NbDJQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/lRWOJSkPcby1Iv3A3NbDJQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8905372023582458},{"business_id":"kFwYrDiiVuaEuw1WIV260w","photo_id":"h9G5qRdvKJrM6Th_zSa9eQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/h9G5qRdvKJrM6Th_zSa9eQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.83